  "title": "Shui Zhu Yu",
  "description": "A rich and flavorful Chinese dish made with tender beef and a spicy red curry paste, perfect for a solo dinner. Shui Zhu Yu is a Cantonese dish that translates to \"water boiled fish\" but in this variation we substitute beef for fish.",
