  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a wok over medium-high heat, then add the ginger and garlic and stir-fry until fragrant.",
    "Add the beef and stir-fry for 2-3 minutes until browned, then remove from the wok.",
    "Add the red curry paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the soy sauce, oyster sauce, rice vinegar, and water, and stir to combine.",
    "Return the beef to the wok and stir-fry for 2-3 minutes until coated in the sauce.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer to a serving dish and drizzle with sesame oil.",
    "Garnish with scallions and serve hot."
